Index a local path into the code graph

Usage:
  eshu index [path] [flags]

Flags:
      --discovery-report string   Write a discovery advisory JSON report to this path
  -f, --force                     Force re-index
  -h, --help                      help for index

Global Flags:
      --database string   Temporarily override database backend
  -V, --visual            Show results as interactive graph visualization
